  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! China-Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to smallholder inclusive sustainable Palm Oil production and trade, in which workers in plantations and mills work under Decent working conditions, forests and land rights are equally protected, and smallholders are rewarded for the investments made to produce under sustainable conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
